log_free = "The frozen ChainPosition requires a real event index. Both producers use ErrReceiptPosition for log-free success/reversion; the API sends 503 INTEGRITY_QUARANTINED with no receipt, while SDK state retains actual committed inclusion. No event index is invented."

[finding.receipt-chain-identity-unchecked]
