path = "Actual chain-125/1337 nodes produce committed signed transactions, receipts and blocks -> HTTP transport (selected calls routed to a second actual node without payload modification) -> production RegisterNetworkReads consumer independently refuses foreign, conflicting or missing committed evidence."
